l. Tilowat, Hadith, Naat and national anthem.CALLING ATTEMION NOTICE2. SYED RAFIULLAH SHAZIA MARRI to invite attention of the Minister forRailways, to a matter of urgent public importance regarding prolonged and alarming delay in thedisbursement of gratuity, benevolent fund, marriage grants, Ieave encashment, farewell grant to PakistanRailways employees and their families, causing grave concem amongst the public.INTRODUCTION OF BILLS
3. MS. SIIAISTA PERVAIZ to move for leave to inhoduce a Bill to provide the fortification ofessential foods in Islamabad Capital Territory for the prevention of micronutrient deficiencies and thepromotion ofpublic health [The Islamabad Capital Tenitory Food Fortification Bill, 2025].4. Also to introduce the Bill, ifleave is granted.5. MR. TAIIIR IQBAL to move for leave to introduce a Bill further to amend the Co-operativeSocieties Act 1925 [The Cooperative Societies (Amendment) Bill,2025].6. Also to introduce the Bill, ifleave is granted.7. SHAZIA MARRI to molle for leave to introduce a Bill further to amend the Pakistan PenalCode, 1860 (XLV of 1860) and the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1898 (V of lE98) [The Criminal Laws(Amendment) Bill,2025) (Section 498D and Schedule Il).E. Also to inhoduce the Bill, if leave is granted.9. DR SHARMILA FARUQUI to move for leave to introduce a Bill further to amend thePublic Interest Disclosures Act, 2017 lThe Public Interest Disclosures (Amendment) Bill,2025l.10. Also to introduce the Bill, ifleave is granted.11, MR. MUHAMMAD RIAZ FATYA.I\A to move for leave to introduce a Bill further to amendthe Constitution of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan [The Constitution (Amendment) Bill,2025] (Articles l,51, 59, 106, 154, 175A, 198 and 218).12. Also to introduce the Bill, ifleave is granted.13. DR. SHARMILA FARUQUI to move for leave to introduce a Bill firrther to amend thePakistan Penal Code, 1860 (XLV of 1860) and the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1898 (V of 1898) [TheCriminal Laws (Amendment) Bill,20251(Section 498D and Schedule II).14. Also to introduce the Bill, if leave is granted.15. SAHIBZADA SIBGHATULLAH to move for leave to introduce a Bill further to amend theElections Act 2017 [The Elections (Amendment) BILL,20251.16. Also to inhoduce the Bill, ifleave is granted.17. MR. AWAIS HAIDER JAKHARMR. KHAWAJA SHERAZ MEHMOODMR. MUTIAMMAD SIHBBIR ALI QT]RESHIMALIK MUHAMMAD AAMIR DOGAR to move for leave to introduce a Bill firrther toamend the Constitution of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan [The Constitution (Amendment) Bill, 2025](Articles l40A and l60A).lE. Also to introduce the Bill, if leave is granted.
