19. MS. NOSHEEN IPTIKIIAR to move for leave to introduce a Bill further to amendthe Guardians and Wards Act, 1890 [The Guardians and Wards (Amendment) Bill,2025]20. Also to introduce the Bill, if leave is granted.21. MR. MIJHAMMAD RIAZ FATYANA to move for leave to introduce a Bill further to amendthe Legal Practitioners and Bar Councils Ac! 1973 [The Legal Practitioners and Bar Councils (Amendment)Bill,202sl.22. Also to introduce the Bill, if leave is ganted.23. MS. SHAIIIDA REHMANI to move for leave to introduce a Bill to provide for regulationof digital and visual media content, prohibit obscenity and indecency, and protect Islamic social values,national culture, and public morality in Pakistan [The Prevention of Obscenity and Indecency in DigitalMedia Bill, 20251.24. Also to introduce the Bill, if teave is granted.25, KHAWAJA IZIIAR UL HASSAN to move for leave to introduce a Bill to provide for theestablishment of Allied Institute at Multan [The Allied Institute, Multan Bill, 2025].26. AIso to introduce the Bilt, if leave is ganted.
27. MR. SOHAIL StlLTAll to move for leave to introduce a Bill further to amend theService Tribunals Act, 1973 [The Service Tribunals (Amendment) Bill,2025).28. Also to inhoduce the Bill, ifleave is granted.
29, MS. SHAHIDA REHMANI to move for leave to introduce a Bill further to amend theNational Database and Registration Authority Ordinance, 2000 [The National Database and RegistrationAuthority (Amendment) Bill, 20251.30. Also to introduce the Bill, ifleave is granted.31. MS. SEHAR KAMRAII to move for leave to introduce a Bill to prohibit theemployment of the children and regulate the employment of adolescents within the Islamabad CapitalTerritory [The Islamabad Child and Adolescent Labour (Prohibition and Regulation) Bill,2025].32. Also to inhoduce the Bill, if leave is granted.33. MS. SHAHIDA REHMAIII to move for leave to introduce a Bill to promote fair competition andend electricity distribution monopoly in urban center areas [The Multi-Vendor Electricity Distribution Bill,202s1.34. Also to introduce the Bill, if leave is granted.
35. SYED ABRAR ALI SHAH to move for leave to introduce a Bill to rationalize the distanceand equity of toll plazas on national highways and motorways [The Toll Plaza Rationalization and EquityBtll,2025l.36. Also to introduce the Bill, if leave is granted.LEGISLATIVE BUSINESS37. MS. IIUMA AKHTER CHUGHTAI,MS. NOSIIEEN IF-IIKHAR,MR. A]\IJUMAQEELKHANMS. MUSARRAT ASIF KHAWAJA to move that the Bill turther to amend the LegalPractitioners and Bar Councils Act, 1973 [The Legal Practitioners and Bar Councils (Amendment) Bill,2025], as passed by the Senate, be taken into consideration at once.3E. MS. HI]MA AKHTER CHUGHTAI,MS. NOSHEEN IFTIKTIAR,MR. ANJUM AQEEL KHAI{
